Purpose

Defines Automatic Hardware Protection.

Monitored Conditions

• Over Temperature
• Reverse Charging Current
• Sensor Failure
• ADS1115 ALERT
• System Fault

Design Rules

• ADS1115 ALERT Operates A 5V Opto-Isolated Relay Module.
• Relay Interrupts The Contactor Authorization Circuit.
• Reverse Charging Below Freezing Shall Open Authorization.
• Fault Recovery By Software Or Power Cycle.

